2. Depth Validation System
- Monotonic depth curve validation
- Geological constraint enforcement per formation
- Gap detection with 200-point threshold classification:
  - Geological features (cased holes, non-logging zones)
  - Data errors requiring intervention
- Formation-specific depth range validation

3. Geological Constraint System
- Formation boundary enforcement
- Impedance value range validation (thousands scale)
- Porosity percentage bounds checking (0-100%)
- Shape validation against known geological patterns

4. Quality Assessment Framework
- Gap quality metrics based on geological context
- Formation-specific validation rules
- Well data completeness verification
- Cross-reference validation between related measurements

5. Mandatory Safety Fields
- Well name
- UWI (Unique Well Identifier)
- Field designation
- Operating company
- Validated depth range
- Formation markers
- Safety classification level

